msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Ugh... I wasn't trying to con anyone... I even built the\r\n"
"damn tuna farm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"That's enough out of you. Your Okinawa office was a sham,\r\n"
"too. When I went there, all I found was some café."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "What!? You... You went all the way to Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Damn... I guess there's nowhere left to run..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I think it's about time you paid me back for the share\r\n"
"I bought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "All right... Here's your 10,000 yen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"And to make up for all the trouble I caused you, please\r\n"
"take this, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Tuna & Egg Sandwich<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "A tuna and egg sandwich?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Yeah..."
